      "validation": ["SCOPE_REQUIRED"],
      "notes": "When stock is queried in the verified warehouse scope, AvailableStock temporarily equals positive unexpired physical stock. Expired/negative lots return zero. APIs that did not query stock keep AvailableStock null. ERP reservation/blocked-stock confirmation remains open."
